te (Drive) as well as the encrypted remote (Drive > Crypt). Same result.\r\n\r\n#### What is your rclone version (output from `rclone version`)\r\n```\r\nrclone v1.52.0\r\n- os/arch: linux/amd64\r\n- go version: go1.14.3\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n#### Which OS you are using and how many bits (eg Windows 7, 64 bit)\r\nLinux Debian 10.x\r\n\r\n\r\n####  Which cloud storage system are you using? (eg Google Drive)\r\nGoogle Drive\r\n\r\n\r\n#### The command you were trying to run (eg `rclone copy /tmp remote:tmp`)\r\n```\r\nrclone dedupe -v --fast-list --checkers=24 --dedupe-mode skip Remote:\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n#### A log from the command with the `-vv` flag (eg output from `rclone -vv copy /tmp remote:tmp`)\r\n Lots of:\r\n```\r\n2020/06/08 19:26:07 NOTICE: Path/To/File: Found 2 duplicates - deleting identical copies\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"tcf909","id":1562915,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NjI5MTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1562915?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tcf909","html_url":"https://github.com/tcf909","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tcf909/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tcf909/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tcf909/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tcf909/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tcf909/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tcf909/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tcf909/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tcf909/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tcf909/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rclone/rclone/issues/4321/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rclone/rclone/iss